 Metro, give me a light, will you?

248
00:22:38,760 --> 00:22:39,740
 I want to try and cook this.

249
00:22:43,830 --> 00:22:53,840
 Who dared, dared give fire to the mortals?

250
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:54,160
 Who?

251
00:22:54,340 --> 00:22:55,590
 I was disobeyed.

252
00:22:55,690 --> 00:22:56,510
 Thunder and lightning.

253
00:22:56,870 --> 00:22:57,490
 General alert.

254
00:22:57,630 --> 00:22:58,670
 I want the guilty one.

255
00:22:59,550 --> 00:22:59,990
 Vulcan.

256
00:23:01,020 --> 00:23:03,540
 Here is what you will do.

257
00:23:03,890 --> 00:23:09,440
 You will create a woman who has greater beauty than any woman ever created and name her Pandora.

258
00:23:10,370 --> 00:23:12,210
 To the mortals with a box of misfortune.

259
00:23:12,490 --> 00:23:14,750
 There can be no question of mortals being our equals.

260
00:23:15,030 --> 00:23:17,410
 They will start with a fire and end up with a doomsday bomb.

261
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:20,060
 We're going to stay here for a long time.

262
00:23:20,260 --> 00:23:21,840
 Go to work and work well.

263
00:23:57,140 --> 00:24:12,830
 You have any idea?

264
00:24:12,830 --> 00:24:16,990
 Surely spotted.

265
00:24:17,170 --> 00:24:18,430
 We have to find another way.

266
00:24:19,500 --> 00:24:20,660
 Give it a try.

267
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:47,170
 Start the power.

268
00:24:47,390 --> 00:24:48,040
 I'll join you there.

269
00:24:55,660 --> 00:25:03,160
 What do you say? Say, let's go.

270
00:25:27,870 --> 00:25:58,010
 Is this planet mytho, as old Jupiter would say, destiny take its course.

271
00:25:58,640 --> 00:26:02,500
 When I think that we're going to be a part of those people's mythology,

272
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:08,640
 make you a giant, a colossus, eh? Titan, Prometheus, why not?

273
00:26:09,120 --> 00:26:12,950
 You as a goddess, pretty nice idea. Athena, for instance.

274
00:26:13,350 --> 00:26:16,290
 And they might construct a great city in your honor.

